          "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/$Libra_cryptocurrency_scandal",
          "thread": "Celebrity and political insider exits",
          "why": "LIBRA/Milei and CR7 headlines dominated because readers were drawn to the outrage of politically-connected insiders profiting while retail was wiped out — a named, powerful face attached to the theft."
