        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Detection tools beaten at scale",
          "why": "The 42,000-victim meme coin story spiked because even purpose-built rug-pull detectors failed, exposing a systemic gap in the infrastructure retail investors rely on for protection."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://www.justice.gov/usao-sdny/pr/three-united-kingdom-nationals-charged-connection-evolved-apes-nft-scam",
